<view class="identity-edit-page">
  <view class="edit-header">
    <view class="edit-hint">真实原厂型号维护在这里；物料主数据只维护 J-999 / M-999 这类测试料代码壳。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{ loading }}" class="loading-state">
    <van-loading type="spinner" vertical>加载测试料主数据...</van-loading>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{ materialOptions.length === 0 }}" class="empty-card">
    <van-empty description="暂无已启用测试料主数据">
      <view class="empty-tip">请先新增并启用测试料代码壳，再回来维护原厂型号。</view>
      <view class="empty-actions">
        <van-button round type="primary" size="small" bind:click="onManageMaterialMaster">去维护测试料主数据</van-button>
      </view>
    </van-empty>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="form-section">
      <view class="section-title">基础信息</view>
      <van-cell-group inset>
        <van-cell
          title="测试料产品代码"
          required
          is-link
          value="{{ form.product_code || '请选择' }}"
          bind:click="onShowMaterialPicker"
        />
        <view wx:if="{{ selectedMaterial }}" class="selected-material-summary">
          所属物料：{{ selectedMaterial.material_name || '测试料主数据' }}｜{{ selectedMaterial.category === 'film' ? '膜材' : '化材' }}
        </view>

        <van-field
          label="原厂型号"
          value="{{ form.supplier_model }}"
          placeholder="例如 TEST-CHEM-01"
          required
          clearable
          error-message="{{ supplierModelError }}"
          bind:change="onSupplierModelInput"
        />

        <van-field
          label="供应商"
          value="{{ form.supplier }}"
          placeholder="选填；作为入库和预打印默认供应商"
          clearable
          bind:change="onSupplierInput"
        />
      </van-cell-group>
      <view class="field-guide">
        供应商不会参与重复判断。同一测试料产品代码下，相同原厂型号只能维护一条，避免库存身份被拆散。
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="submit-btn-container" wx:if="{{ !loading && materialOptions.length > 0 }}">
    <van-button
      type="primary"
      block
      round
      size="large"
      loading="{{ submitting }}"
      disabled="{{ submitting }}"
      bind:click="onSubmit"
    >
      创建测试料型号
    </van-button>
  </view>

  <van-popup show="{{ showMaterialPicker }}" position="bottom" round bind:close="onMaterialPickerCancel">
    <van-picker
      columns="{{ materialOptionLabels }}"
      default-index="{{ materialIndex || 0 }}"
      show-toolbar
      bind:confirm="onMaterialPickerConfirm"
      bind:cancel="onMaterialPickerCancel"
    />
  </van-popup>

  <van-toast id="van-toast" />
  <van-dialog id="van-dialog" />
</view>
